Package: ggextreme
Type: Package
Title: Flourish Style Animated Charts for 'ggplot2'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Ahmad", "Sofi-Mahmudi", email = "ahmad.pub@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A small collection of presentation grade charts that 'ggplot2'
    does not ship with. The first is a bar chart race that reproduces the
    'flourish.studio' bar race design down to its measured geometry: values
    and ranks are interpolated on a uniform time grid, every frame is drawn
    as an ordinary 'ggplot2' plot, and the frames are encoded to GIF or MP4.
